{"data":{"body":"**P1:** A scope fatal is published immediately, but `closeHandlerScopes` continues closing earlier scopes. Returning here skips the bounded handler handoff, allowing invocation-end hooks and plugin release to run while an earlier scope is still cleaning up on its owner thread. Preserve the fatal outcome, but wait for the incomplete `handlerFuture` before returning it. Add a regression with a later scope failing fatally and an earlier scope blocking during close.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76gLSc","finding_digest":"8d46bffd00958a34278ec255962abfc973799de567b2671eb47219b90c47edc3","finding_id":"arf_v1_rvdl77iaswfdij4oyjkzmkv7zf","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durable-executor::await-handler-scopes::fatal-skips-scope-handoff","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durable-executor::await-handler-scopes::fatal-skips-scope-handoff","line":394,"observation_digest":"6a9fcee192f03146d78c781704a910fd8857bc2fa03fe5cd414d927e1a47f27d","observation_id":"aro_v1_nkp45yms6ayunv4mpalqjkiq7w","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rvdl77iaswfdij4oyjkzmkv7zf","published_at":"2026-10-07T03:22:04Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vwqkwiy72tlizudgfzrvf5lwtb","reviewed_base_sha":"f4e4e1db81c6fb0fbbaf25815d73757abf3fda7c","reviewed_head_sha":"8f9a53bee6bf441644366ee4b1dce8df1a59265b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":394,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_kioxtf3dkdvvyleyyonte2x6c5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T03:22:04Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
